    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve a path through this planet:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a variety of environments, and fix broken down portals using power cores you find in the environment. With your grit, wits, and some elbow grease you\u2019ll overcome and overpower any obstacle in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >String together your on unique attacks:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Blights Grasp you can mix and match your different fighting styles with the alien elements you can harness, creating a variety of effects and combinations. The act of mixing these elements and styles is quick, allowing for on the fly moves and strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3rd Person Action Game centering on melee combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ranged attack to extend combos and hit far away enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power cores to buy power ups and fix portals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate environments using your jumps and dashes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different fighting styles and elements using the radial menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Carve a path through this planet:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your way through a variety of environments, and fix broken down portals using power cores you find in the environment. With your grit, wits, and some elbow grease you\u2019ll overcome and overpower any obstacle in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/4674fef63e76d24817191546b68598b4.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >String together your on unique attacks:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Blights Grasp you can mix and match your different fighting styles with the alien elements you can harness, creating a variety of effects and combinations. The act of mixing these elements and styles is quick, allowing for on the fly moves and strategies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/7f1a067870b80e5912293a33f03b168b.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3rd Person Action Game centering on melee combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ranged attack to extend combos and hit far away enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect power cores to buy power ups and fix portals.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate environments using your jumps and dashes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between different fighting styles and elements using the radial menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.poster.avif?t=1746210637\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.webm?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470150/extras/c74dae8c9a111e345a64085711f8f3d5.mp4?t=1746210637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
